# Video Poster Image Placeholder

This file indicates where a video poster image should be placed.

The actual image should be:
- Filename: video-poster.jpg
- Location: public/images/video-poster.jpg
- Size: 1280x720 pixels (16:9 aspect ratio)
- Format: JPG
- Content: A professional printing/equipment related image that serves as a video thumbnail

For now, the video component will work without this image, but adding it would improve the user experience by showing a proper thumbnail before the video plays.
